<title>UK: TABLE - Loftus Road first interim results.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Loftus Road first interim results.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Interim results from May 13, 1996 to November 30, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence) loss	16.2</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 nil</p>
<p> Pretax loss		4.4</p>
<p> Turnover		   3.1</p>
<p>NOTE - This is the company's first set of results since admission to the Alternative Investment Market in October 1996. No dividend is intended for the year to May 31, 1997. Trading loss before transfer fees 1.5 million stg. Net transfer fees payable 2.9 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - Loftus Road Plc.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 4365</p>
